--><rss xmlns:sparkle="http://www.andymatuschak.org/xml-namespaces/sparkle" version="2.0"><channel><title>extend.computer updates</title><item><title>extend.computer 0.2.1</title><sparkle:version>5</sparkle:version><sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.1</sparkle:shortVersionString><sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion><description>&lt;h3&gt;Patch Changes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/DaniGuardiola/extend.computer/commit/c9e43df398c9e382581829bf4f8dd590bdab9754"&gt;&lt;code&gt;c9e43df&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; Thanks &lt;a href="https://github.com/DaniGuardiola"&gt;@DaniGuardiola&lt;/a&gt;! - Bring the desktop app to the foreground after browser sign-in. Close the browser tab when permitted, with a branded success page as a fallback.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/DaniGuardiola/extend.computer/commit/2ecc29087c04336eabc4aa3f33d416f8de0b249e"&gt;&lt;code&gt;2ecc290&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; Thanks &lt;a href="https://github.com/DaniGuardiola"&gt;@DaniGuardiola&lt;/a&gt;! - Fix a crash when opening macOS Accessibility settings and restore Wi-Fi optimization setup in signed releases. Keep permission guides beside System Settings with a small overlap, visible arrows, and safer positioning near screen edges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description><enclosure url="https://github.com/DaniGuardiola/extend.computer/releases/download/v0.2.1/extend.computer-0.2.1-universal.dmg" length="14276019" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="zxsOt8lPg3qrHERh8GjHdbnIMDUq8li4H5DLXws2kUMDdexoxdVgVcvo+MXvGSPm71KNWMbAj0yzb58i/25LCQ=="></enclosure></item><item><title>extend.computer 0.2.0</title><sparkle:version>3</sparkle:version><sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.0</sparkle:shortVersionString><sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion><description>&lt;h3&gt;Minor Changes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/DaniGuardiola/extend.computer/commit/b99827c6e1dde9aa78fc7b729fd8557d80fc9681"&gt;&lt;code&gt;b99827c&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; Thanks &lt;a href="https://github.com/DaniGuardiola"&gt;@DaniGuardiola&lt;/a&gt;! - Add native macOS updates, update channels, and offline release history. Check device protocol compatibility before starting a connection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description><enclosure url="https://github.com/DaniGuardiola/extend.computer/releases/download/v0.2.0/extend.computer-0.2.0-universal.dmg" length="14266489" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="P0xXDdQsz+1d/Qe2WfpWV7IewUUXRoilsClSEQXPvh624uT0vmQ7P4EUxVpXh+yPMU7cI+387rsnCFss2kcRAA=="></enclosure></item><item><title>extend.computer 0.1.0</title><sparkle:version>1</sparkle:version><sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.0</sparkle:shortVersionString><sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion><description>&lt;h3&gt;Initial preview&lt;/h3&gt;
